  <summary>Multi-timezone clock applet for the COSMIC panel</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Show the current time in any number of timezones directly in the COSMIC panel. Add clocks, label them, and switch between 12/24-hour time with or without seconds and the date.</p>
  </description>
